## Key Hapi Patterns

- Routes export `ServerRoute[]` arrays with `{ method, path, handler }` configs
- Plugins (swagger, auth) are registered via `server.register([...])`
- Handlers return `h.response(data).code(status)` — no `res.send()` or `next()`
- Error handling: services throw `AppError` subclasses, `onPreResponse` ext catches them
- No middleware — use `server.ext()` lifecycle hooks and plugins instead

